We must use only public observer methods: this.get(i) is public, list.get(i) also. list is a parameter of type AttributeList; we can call its get method.

Thus final assert:

assert (list != null) => \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < list.size(); this.get(i).equals(list.get(i));

